      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 86.74019501569312,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Stock Price Change Notifications/Alerts",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Stock Price Change Notifications/Alerts",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 529,
      "versionNonce": 1048727815,
      "index": "bAj",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "72pc5qPfpjXESY3k-wjsW",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": -19.250664073102598,
      "y": 26940.830156740376,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "width": 1766.7520857449263,
      "height": 1355.6902946264704,
      "seed": 57810119,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1728525747034,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 60.252901983398594,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "** Non-Functional Requirements ** \n- Scalability: System should handle millions of rules and \n  thousands of stock updates per second.\n\n- Low Latency: Notifications should be sent to users \n  within one minute.\n\n- High Availability: System must remain available during \n  high traffic or stock market volatility.\n\n- Fault Tolerance: The system should be resilient to \n  failures in external stock APIs and notification services.\n\n- Data Consistency: Rules and stock data must remain \n  consistent even in a distributed setup.\n\n- Security: Users' data and subscriptions must be secured, \n  particularly notifications and stock preferences.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "** Non-Functional Requirements ** \n- Scalability: System should handle millions of rules and \n  thousands of stock updates per second.\n\n- Low Latency: Notifications should be sent to users \n  within one minute.\n\n- High Availability: System must remain available during \n  high traffic or stock market volatility.\n\n- Fault Tolerance: The system should be resilient to \n  failures in external stock APIs and notification services.\n\n- Data Consistency: Rules and stock data must remain \n  consistent even in a distributed setup.\n\n- Security: Users' data and subscriptions must be secured, \n  particularly notifications and stock preferences.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 265,
      "versionNonce": 1697139783,
      "index": "bAk",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "fldlyzLMwwISLRkpzUM7p",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": -27.291132974569337,
      "y": 28537.414388323406,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "width": 1861.77978515625,
      "height": 1173.8478781806637,
      "seed": 2053921001,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1728525756644,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 55.23990014967833,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "** Back-of-the-Envelope Estimation **\n- Users: Assume 10 million users, each tracking 10 stocks.\n\n- Rules: 1 million users may define 3 rules per stock, l\n    eading to 30 million rules to scan.\n\n- Stock Data: With ~5000 stocks, receiving updates every \n   sec for price changes, that’s around 5000 updates per sec.\n\n- Notification Throughput: 1% of rules trigger notifications \n  per minute (10,000 notifications/min).\n\n- Storage: Each rule can take 200 bytes, resulting in ~6GB \n  of storage for all user rules.\n\n- Latency: Each rule check and notification should occur within 1 sec.\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "** Back-of-the-Envelope Estimation **\n- Users: Assume 10 million users, each tracking 10 stocks.\n\n- Rules: 1 million users may define 3 rules per stock, l\n    eading to 30 million rules to scan.\n\n- Stock Data: With ~5000 stocks, receiving updates every \n   sec for price changes, that’s around 5000 updates per sec.\n\n- Notification Throughput: 1% of rules trigger notifications \n  per minute (10,000 notifications/min).\n\n- Storage: Each rule can take 200 bytes, resulting in ~6GB \n  of storage for all user rules.\n\n- Latency: Each rule check and notification should occur within 1 sec.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 562,
      "versionNonce": 1748068649,
      "index": "bAl",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "7BT6Ho0N-VE3Koj7GCTdt",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 38.12987438296568,
      "y": 29881.231014897072,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "width": 1687.4283856563318,
      "height": 2047.5307618348147,
      "seed": 733266537,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1728525765374,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 51.188269045870406,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "** API Endpoints **\n\nUser Management:\n - POST /users/register: Register a new user.\n - POST /users/login: Authenticate the user.\n\nStock Subscription:\n - Subscribe to stock price changes.\n     POST /users/{userId}/stocks/subscribe\n     Payload: { \n                  \"stockSymbol\": \"ABC\", \n                  \"rules\": [{ \n                               \"type\": \"price\", \n                               \"operator\": \">\", \n                               \"value\": 100 \n                              }] \n                }\n\n - Un-Subscribe to stock price changes.\n     POST /users/{userId}/stocks/unsubscribe\n\n - Get list of subscribed stocks.\n    GET /users/{userId}/stocks\n\nRule Management:\n - POST /users/{userId}/rules: Create a rule for a stock.\n - GET /users/{userId}/rules: List all rules set by the user.\n - DELETE /users/{userId}/rules/{ruleId}: Delete a specific rule.\n\nNotification Management:\n - GET /users/{userId}/notifications: Retrieve user notifications.\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "** API Endpoints **\n\nUser Management:\n - POST /users/register: Register a new user.\n - POST /users/login: Authenticate the user.\n\nStock Subscription:\n - Subscribe to stock price changes.\n     POST /users/{userId}/stocks/subscribe\n     Payload: { \n                  \"stockSymbol\": \"ABC\", \n                  \"rules\": [{ \n                               \"type\": \"price\", \n                               \"operator\": \">\", \n                               \"value\": 100 \n                              }] \n                }\n\n - Un-Subscribe to stock price changes.\n     POST /users/{userId}/stocks/unsubscribe\n\n - Get list of subscribed stocks.\n    GET /users/{userId}/stocks\n\nRule Management:\n - POST /users/{userId}/rules: Create a rule for a stock.\n - GET /users/{userId}/rules: List all rules set by the user.\n - DELETE /users/{userId}/rules/{ruleId}: Delete a specific rule.\n\nNotification Management:\n - GET /users/{userId}/notifications: Retrieve user notifications.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 144,
      "versionNonce": 472743303,
      "index": "bAm",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "Zsr-msYqUmY6PN4in4lYT",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 76.10376184610368,
      "y": 32067.59126187588,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "width": 1522.490062713623,
      "height": 1110.5539772727248,
      "seed": 1725541833,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1728526247337,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 52.26136363636351,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "** Database Tables **\n- Users: user_id, email, name, phone_number\n\n- Stocks: stock_id, symbol, name, last_price, timestamp\n\n- Subscriptions: subscription_id, user_id, stock_id\n\n- Rules:\n  rule_id, subscription_id, \n  rule_type (e.g., price above, price below, moving average), \n  operator (e.g., >, <), \n  threshold_value, status (active, triggered)\n  created_at\n\n- Notifications:\n  notification_id, user_id, rule_id, message, \n  timestamp, status (sent, failed)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "** Database Tables **\n- Users: user_id, email, name, phone_number\n\n- Stocks: stock_id, symbol, name, last_price, timestamp\n\n- Subscriptions: subscription_id, user_id, stock_id\n\n- Rules:\n  rule_id, subscription_id, \n  rule_type (e.g., price above, price below, moving average), \n  operator (e.g., >, <), \n  threshold_value, status (active, triggered)\n  created_at\n\n- Notifications:\n  notification_id, user_id, rule_id, message, \n  timestamp, status (sent, failed)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
