      "text": "+---------------------+\n|    API Gateway   |\n+---------+-----------+\n          |\n          v\n+---------------------+           +--------------------+\n| Location Ingestor|           | Cache (e.g., Redis)|\n| Service             |-----------| Stores recent     |\n|                       |           | minute-level data |\n+---------+-----------+           +--------------------+\n          |\n          v\n+---------------------+\n|  Stream Processor|\n| (e.g., Kafka, Flink) |\n| Aggregates data  |\n| into 1-minute       |\n| buckets             |\n+---------+-----------+\n          |\n          v\n+---------------------------+\n| Time-Series Database|\n| (e.g., InfluxDB)        |\n| Stores last 20 mins   |\n| of data                  |\n+---------+----------------+\n          |\n          v\n+------------------------+\n|  Heat Map Service   |\n| Queries DB and      |\n| Cache for data       |\n| Generates heat map |\n+---------+--------------+\n          |\n          v\n+-----------------------+\n|    Real-Time Tool  |\n|   for Operations    |\n| Displays heat map  |\n+-----------------------+\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
