      "text": "+---------------------+\n|    API Gateway   |\n+---------+-----------+\n          |\n          v\n+---------------------+           +--------------------+\n| Location Ingestor|           | Cache (e.g., Redis)|\n| Service              |-----------| Stores recent     |\n|                        |           | minute-level data |\n+---------+-----------+           +--------------------+\n          |\n          v\n+---------------------+\n|  Stream Processor|\n| (e.g., Kafka, Flink) |\n| Aggregates data  |\n| into 1-minute       |\n| buckets             |\n+---------+-----------+\n          |\n          v\n+--------------------------+\n| Time-Series Database|\n| (e.g., InfluxDB)        |\n| Stores last 20 mins   |\n| of data                  |\n+---------+-----------------+\n          |\n          v\n+---------------------+           +------------------------+\n|  Heat Map Service. |          |   Batch Processor  |\n| Queries DB and     |         | Processes hourly    |\n| Cache for data      |---------| summaries from the |\n| Generates heat map|         | stream every hour   |\n+---------+-----------+           +---------+--------------+\n          |                                  |\n          v                                  v\n+---------------------+           +---------------------+\n|    Real-Time Tool   |           |   Object Storage    |\n|   for Operations    |           | (e.g., S3)          |\n| Displays heat map   |           | Stores hourly       |\n+---------------------+           | summaries for 24 hrs|\n                                   +---------+-----------+\n                                              |\n                                              v\n                                   +---------------------+\n                                   | Research Data       |\n                                   | Service             |\n                                   | Provides access to  |\n                                   | summarized data     |\n                                   +---------+-----------+\n                                              |\n                                              v\n                                   +---------------------+\n                                   | External Consumers  |\n                                   | (Cities, Researchers)|\n                                   | Access summarized   |\n                                   | data by hour        |\n                                   +---------------------+\n",
