      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Periodically seal chunks, produce downsampled aggregates (1m, 5m).\n- Move data to Warm columnar (fast scans, cheap storage), then Cold \n  object store (Parquet + manifest).",
      "fontSize": 29.325585140680168,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
