      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "APIs\nPOST /allocations - Request capacity matching constraints.\n    Sample Req:  { \"tenantId\": \"tenant-42\",\n              \"resourceType\": \"compute\",\n              \"cpu\": 8,\n              \"memoryGb\": 32,\n              \"region\": \"us-west-2\",\n              \"preferredAzs\": [\"us-west-2a\", \"us-west-2b\"] }\n\n    Resp: { \"allocationId\": \"alloc-781\", \"resourceId\": \"host-5512\",\n  \"state\": \"RESERVED\", \"reservationExpiresAt\": \"2026-09-05T14:20:00Z\" }\n\nGET /allocations/{allocationId}  - Read reservation/provisioning status.\nDELETE /allocations/{allocationId} - Release/cancel allocated capacity.\n",
      "fontSize": 35.97702750021974,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "APIs\nPOST /allocations - Request capacity matching constraints.\n    Sample Req:  { \"tenantId\": \"tenant-42\",\n              \"resourceType\": \"compute\",\n              \"cpu\": 8,\n              \"memoryGb\": 32,\n              \"region\": \"us-west-2\",\n              \"preferredAzs\": [\"us-west-2a\", \"us-west-2b\"] }\n\n    Resp: { \"allocationId\": \"alloc-781\", \"resourceId\": \"host-5512\",\n  \"state\": \"RESERVED\", \"reservationExpiresAt\": \"2026-09-05T14:20:00Z\" }\n\nGET /allocations/{allocationId}  - Read reservation/provisioning status.\nDELETE /allocations/{allocationId} - Release/cancel allocated capacity.\n",
