      "updated": 1788724199375,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Allocation API\n- auth + validate\n- idempotency handling\n- forwarding valid requests \n   into admission/placement",
      "fontSize": 24.898522708353322,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Allocation API\n- auth + validate\n- idempotency handling\n- forwarding valid requests \n   into admission/placement",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "mBpVJ1J9Wgc1opasESlbG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3506.8142663549947,
      "y": 71099.05046570968,
      "width": 349.67765585640996,
      "height": 169.32566173256558,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 71278594,
      "version": 518,
      "versionNonce": 1647219694,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788724199375,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Admission / Quota\n- quota + rate limit\n- fairness / priority\n- reject before placement\n- protects allocator/store",
      "fontSize": 27.09210587721049,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Admission / Quota\n- quota + rate limit\n- fairness / priority\n- reject before placement\n- protects allocator/store",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YSIsEuZc1Czp59tVrS6HV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3937.313826122555,
      "y": 71050.33369996333,
      "width": 631.8790239832485,
      "height": 123.36166608090015,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1836431042,
      "version": 737,
      "versionNonce": 55698990,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788724199375,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Before doing any expensive placement work, \nI run admission control. It enforces tenant quotas, \nrate limits, and priority so one tenant or a traffic \nburst cannot overwhelm the allocator.",
      "fontSize": 24.67233321618001,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Before doing any expensive placement work, \nI run admission control. It enforces tenant quotas, \nrate limits, and priority so one tenant or a traffic \nburst cannot overwhelm the allocator.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7t6FlBeF20rs-bOF4vFNw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3941.6383547740106,
      "y": 71187.50182524486,
      "width": 661.7650721237992,
      "height": 294.51764662170996,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOn",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 550866562,
      "version": 1071,
      "versionNonce": 1087434862,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788724199375,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mental model (Admission / Quota): \nThink of this as the bouncer at the door.\nIt does not decide which table you sit at.\nIt decides whether you are allowed inside.\n\nWhat system achieves: \ntenant isolation, quota enforcement\noverload protection, fairness, priority support",
      "fontSize": 29.451764662170994,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mental model (Admission / Quota): \nThink of this as the bouncer at the door.\nIt does not decide which table you sit at.\nIt decides whether you are allowed inside.\n\nWhat system achieves: \ntenant isolation, quota enforcement\noverload protection, fairness, priority support",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hH11RTMppLFOl7YGumqJ4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3061.958815445567,
      "y": 71662.75570162183,
      "width": 354.0971276568918,
      "height": 151.5516574481467,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOo",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 627377538,
      "version": 878,
      "versionNonce": 108311214,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788724199375,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Placement Allocator\n- filter hard constraints\n- score policy / balance / fit\n- keep top-K candidates\n- CAS claim candidates",
      "fontSize": 24.248265191703474,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Placement Allocator\n- filter hard constraints\n- score policy / balance / fit\n- keep top-K candidates\n- CAS claim candidates",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "IA2fvhQsz2VP4nsmbgewx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3707.831171723884,
      "y": 71513.75336667478,
      "width": 1039.7990993718884,
      "height": 143.58649095158663,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 756368578,
      "version": 900,
      "versionNonce": 1592143086,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788724199375,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Placement allocator filters by hard requirements, scores feasible\nresources based on placement policy, and keeps a small top-K candidate\nset. Because discovery can be stale, it attempts candidates until one\natomic claim succeeds.",
      "fontSize": 28.717298190317326,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Placement allocator filters by hard requirements, scores feasible resources based on placement policy, and keeps a small top-K candidate set. Because discovery can be stale, it attempts candidates until one atomic claim succeeds.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0oyypaNgIGkdbNwCB1bdR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4756.281404622646,
      "y": 71300.01324614228,
      "width": 1053.3328620886016,
      "height": 350.1576069076695,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 937139294,
      "version": 699,
      "versionNonce": 397303598,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788724199375,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mental model (Placement Allocator)\nPlacement is like booking a seat on a busy flight.\nThe search system says: Seats 12A, 12B, 14C appear free\nBut another customer may grab 12A milliseconds before you.\nSo the allocator keeps several candidates and tries them one by one.\n\nWhat system achieves: \nefficient placement, reduced fragmentation, AZ balancing\nscalability, tolerance of stale discovery",
      "fontSize": 31.125120614015067,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mental model (Placement Allocator)\nPlacement is like booking a seat on a busy flight.\nThe search system says: Seats 12A, 12B, 14C appear free\nBut another customer may grab 12A milliseconds before you.\nSo the allocator keeps several candidates and tries them one by one.\n\nWhat system achieves: \nefficient placement, reduced fragmentation, AZ balancing\nscalability, tolerance of stale discovery",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "E8uYxHYR5wWuxlZ8wb_qu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4780.213860328746,
      "y": 71690.18293153004,
      "width": 985.7867011651358,
      "height": 991.5995259725596,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 60542686,
      "version": 867,
      "versionNonce": 1698056558,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788724199375,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "# FILTER: Discard resources that can't satisfy hard requirements.\nRequest:\nregion = us-west-2, cpu >= 8, memory >= 32, type = compute-large\n\nThe allocator should only consider resources satisfying all of those.\nFor example:\nr1: west, 16 CPU, 64 GB  ✓\nr2: west, 4 CPU, 64 GB   ✗\nr3: west, 8 CPU, 32 GB   ✓\nCandidates: r1, r3\n\n# SCORE: Now multiple candidates working.\nWe rank/score them based on policy.\n\nPossible scoring factors:\nfit efficiency, AZ balance, cost, latency etc\n\nExample: r1 = 16 CPU, 64 GB; r4 = 8 CPU, 32 GB\nIf the request needs exactly: 8 CPU / 32 GB\nr4 may score higher because it avoids wasting a larger machine.\n\n# TOP-K:  Do not return one candidate only.\n    Return, say: r4, r8, r17, r21, r9\n\nWhy? Because the index may be stale. By the time we try r4, \nanother allocator may have claimed it. Then we immediately try r8.\n\nThis avoids performing a brand-new expensive search after every conflict.\n",
      "fontSize": 27.35446968200169,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "# FILTER: Discard resources that can't satisfy hard requirements.\nRequest:\nregion = us-west-2, cpu >= 8, memory >= 32, type = compute-large\n\nThe allocator should only consider resources satisfying all of those.\nFor example:\nr1: west, 16 CPU, 64 GB  ✓\nr2: west, 4 CPU, 64 GB   ✗\nr3: west, 8 CPU, 32 GB   ✓\nCandidates: r1, r3\n\n# SCORE: Now multiple candidates working.\nWe rank/score them based on policy.\n\nPossible scoring factors:\nfit efficiency, AZ balance, cost, latency etc\n\nExample: r1 = 16 CPU, 64 GB; r4 = 8 CPU, 32 GB\nIf the request needs exactly: 8 CPU / 32 GB\nr4 may score higher because it avoids wasting a larger machine.\n\n# TOP-K:  Do not return one candidate only.\n    Return, say: r4, r8, r17, r21, r9\n\nWhy? Because the index may be stale. By the time we try r4, \nanother allocator may have claimed it. Then we immediately try r8.\n\nThis avoids performing a brand-new expensive search after every conflict.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "QNDdLphF1rdl48c4uQKHX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4811.521332208344,
      "y": 72721.39412922662,
      "width": 791.8702193808933,
      "height": 402.297512088566,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1071019038,
      "version": 1000,
      "versionNonce": 113699758,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788724199375,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mental model (Availability Index, Derived & rebuildable)\nThink of Zillow listings.\nA listing may say: House available\nbut somebody could just have bought it.\n\nThe listing helps you find candidates.\nThe official property transaction determines ownership.\n\nWhat system achieves: \n     no full-table scans, fast candidate discovery, \n    scalable reads,  flexible search dimensions",
      "fontSize": 29.258000879168435,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mental model (Availability Index, Derived & rebuildable)\nThink of Zillow listings.\nA listing may say: House available\nbut somebody could just have bought it.\n\nThe listing helps you find candidates.\nThe official property transaction determines ownership.\n\nWhat system achieves: \n     no full-table scans, fast candidate discovery, \n    scalable reads,  flexible search dimensions",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "DjW5d0apJPlSH4sAxB0rP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2359.725108738119,
      "y": 71675.6844364054,
      "width": 506.8182205390914,
      "height": 326.42048549423026,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOu",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 803815035,
      "version": 550,
      "versionNonce": 1787381230,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788724199375,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Availability Index answers:\nWhich resources look available right now?\n\nMaintain the availability index as a derived, \nsharded in-mem view, e.g. Redis. Resource \nstate changes from the Authoritative DB, \nasynchronously update the index through \nCDC. Therefore the index can briefly be stale, \nwhich is safe because, actual claim is always \na write against the Authoritative DB record. \nWe can also periodically reconcile  or completely \nrebuild the index from authoritative state.",
      "fontSize": 21.761365699615354,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Availability Index answers:\nWhich resources look available right now?\n\nMaintain the availability index as a derived, \nsharded in-mem view, e.g. Redis. Resource \nstate changes from the Authoritative DB, \nasynchronously update the index through \nCDC. Therefore the index can briefly be stale, \nwhich is safe because, actual claim is always \na write against the Authoritative DB record. \nWe can also periodically reconcile  or completely \nrebuild the index from authoritative state.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9uRv3R9PpGpGWCyitUTVS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2922.05207777991,
      "y": 72025.64501614556,
      "width": 295.25795716147525,
      "height": 147.99407264603758,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOv",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 824915867,
      "version": 578,
      "versionNonce": 1367758894,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788724199375,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Availability Index\n- Redis / sharded in-memory\n- poolKey → candidates\n- updated async from DB/CDC\n- stale OK, rebuildable\n- DB/CAS is final truth",
      "fontSize": 19.73254301947169,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Availability Index\n- Redis / sharded in-memory\n- poolKey → candidates\n- updated async from DB/CDC\n- stale OK, rebuildable\n- DB/CAS is final truth",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
