      "type": "text",
      "x": 10871.823859379823,
      "y": 55264.3836850309,
      "width": 481.2608947753906,
      "height": 1417.9083972084686,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bcW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1586202516,
      "version": 155,
      "versionNonce": 1419059860,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790292630825,
      "created": 1790292586626,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Only chnage is: \nOLD:\nScheduler Nodes\n      |\npartition lease\n      |\n      v\nJob DB\n\n\nNEW:\nScheduler Nodes\n      |\n      v\nZooKeeper / etcd\npartition ownership\n\nScheduler Nodes\n      |\n      v\nJob DB\nactual task state",
      "fontSize": 51.56030535303522,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Only chnage is: \nOLD:\nScheduler Nodes\n      |\npartition lease\n      |\n      v\nJob DB\n\n\nNEW:\nScheduler Nodes\n      |\n      v\nZooKeeper / etcd\npartition ownership\n\nScheduler Nodes\n      |\n      v\nJob DB\nactual task state",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "G_Dfl6Hn-lcPwUCzAFf1Y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11800.1086624952,
      "y": 55236.84185957966,
      "width": 1516.582763671875,
      "height": 378.18364281143295,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bcY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 40277164,
      "version": 227,
      "versionNonce": 2074780332,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790293149489,
      "created": 1790293085561,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Interview script\n“ZooKeeper or etcd manages scheduler ownership, but I still \ndon't rely on that alone for task correctness. The actual \nSCHEDULED-to-READY transition remains conditional in the \ntask database. That protects me even during lease handoff, \nnetwork partitions, or a stale scheduler waking back up.”",
      "fontSize": 50.42448570819106,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Interview script\n“ZooKeeper or etcd manages scheduler ownership, but I still \ndon't rely on that alone for task correctness. The actual \nSCHEDULED-to-READY transition remains conditional in the \ntask database. That protects me even during lease handoff, \nnetwork partitions, or a stale scheduler waking back up.”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
