      "locked": false,
      "text": "when is PostgreSQL actually updated?\nIn the current design, PostgreSQL holds relatively infrequently changing\nmetadata.\nOperation        PostgreSQL        Component responsible\nRegister a new vehicle        INSERT        Vehicle management API (not drawn)\nAssign GPS device to vehicle        UPDATE        Vehicle management API (not\ndrawn)\nAdd dispatcher to fleet        INSERT        Fleet/user management API (not\ndrawn)\nReceive GPS update        READ, if lookup needed        Ingestion API\nDisplay live map        READ for authorization        Map API/Gateway\nUpdate latest GPS position        No operation        Location Processor →\nRedis\nArchive GPS history        No operation        History processor/sink → S3",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "when is PostgreSQL actually updated?\nIn the current design, PostgreSQL holds relatively infrequently changing metadata.\nOperation        PostgreSQL        Component responsible\nRegister a new vehicle        INSERT        Vehicle management API (not drawn)\nAssign GPS device to vehicle        UPDATE        Vehicle management API (not drawn)\nAdd dispatcher to fleet        INSERT        Fleet/user management API (not drawn)\nReceive GPS update        READ, if lookup needed        Ingestion API\nDisplay live map        READ for authorization        Map API/Gateway\nUpdate latest GPS position        No operation        Location Processor → Redis\nArchive GPS history        No operation        History processor/sink → S3",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
